	mn > mpn
	mpn > n:[+ long]
	C:[+ long] > C
	ɡ > k / B_ (your guess is probably better than mine)
	ɡ > {k,j} / V_ (if /j/ resulted, it dropped after /i/; forms with k are “most persistent in the
